The budgets below conserve V5's ten modules and 6,000 uL topology. The current parser row for the whole-use Ginger EO working stock crosses module bookkeeping: its 230 uL nominal Ginger EO fraction belongs to the cortex, while its 660 uL DPG fraction is allocated as 120 uL warm-heart volume hold, 150 uL air-field volume hold, and 390 uL yielding-chamber volume hold.

